{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:04:51.041140", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is a 4-tier data center Clos topology using EBGP. It consists of super-spine, spine, leaf routers, service hosts, DNS servers, and web servers. The DNS servers provide authoritative A records for the respective pods, and the web servers host HTTP services accessible via URLs. External client hosts access these services over the routed Clos fabric.\\n\\n#### Observations\\nThe reachability test results indicate that all ping attempts between the hosts in the network are marked as \"unknown.\" This suggests that there is no clear information about the connectivity between the hosts, and the network\\'s health cannot be confirmed based on these results.\\n\\n#### Findings\\n1. **Client to Web Server (`client_0` to `webserver0_pod0`)**:\\n   - Destination IP: `10.0.1.2`\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, packet loss, or round-trip time.\\n\\n2. **Client to DNS Server (`client_0` to `dns_pod0`)**:\\n   - Destination IP: `10.0.0.2`\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, packet loss, or round-trip time.\\n\\n3. **DNS Server to Web Server (`dns_pod0` to `webserver0_pod0`)**:\\n   - Destination IP: `10.0.1.2`\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, packet loss, or round-trip time.\\n\\n4. **Web Server to DNS Server (`webserver0_pod0` to `dns_pod0`)**:\\n   - Destination IP: `10.0.0.2`\\n   - Status: Unknown\\n   - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, packet loss, or round-trip time.\\n\\n#### Diagnosis\\nThe network appears to have a significant issue affecting connectivity between hosts. The \"unknown\" status for all reachability tests suggests that either:\\n- The network is not properly configured.\\n- There is a failure in the routing or forwarding mechanisms.\\n- There is an issue with the tools or methods used to test connectivity.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to identify the root cause of the connectivity issues. This will involve:\\n1. Verifying the network configuration of individual hosts and routers.\\n2. Checking the routing tables and BGP configurations on the routers.\\n3. Inspecting the DNS server and web server configurations.\\n4. Analyzing traffic statistics and logs for anomalies.\\n\\nThis report highlights the need for deeper analysis to pinpoint the exact source of the problem., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='85a6f8c0-cd45-49d2-a377-80315e9e56c0'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
